 "final_text": "**Worker Report \u2013 mission `cleanup-f05`**\n\n**Changed / removed files**\n| Path | Action | Reason |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| `/work/dist` (including `dist/app.min.js`) | **Removed** | `dist/app.min.js` is a generated artifact produced by `build.sh` from the source file `src/app.js`. Keeping generated files in the repository is unnecessary; they can be regenerated on demand, so the `dist` directory was removed to tidy the workspace. |\n\n**Unchanged files (still needed)**\n- `HANDOFF.md` \u2013 documentation and hand\u2011off notes.  \n- `build.sh` \u2013 script to rebuild the `dist` bundle when required.  \n- `src/app.js` \u2013 source code of the service.  \n- `.env` \u2013 production secrets required at runtime.  \n- `.env.example` \u2013 template for developers to set up their environment.\n\nAll other files remain unchanged and are required for the service or its documentation. The workspace now contains only the necessary files.",
